WEBVTT

00:02.680 --> 00:03.680
No

00:03.760 --> 00:05.160
Let Zhu Yuanzhi go

00:05.240 --> 00:07.573
Why am I worse than Zhu Yuanzhi?

00:10.200 --> 00:11.640
I'm not just Prince of Jin

00:11.720 --> 00:13.120
But also your brother-in-law

00:13.320 --> 00:14.987
This is a near-suicide mission

00:15.200 --> 00:16.867
If something happens to you

00:17.160 --> 00:18.840
I'm afraid I'll lose my composure

00:18.920 --> 00:21.253
Then how can we defend the city?

00:29.280 --> 00:31.280
Xie Xuan is impulsive and emotional

00:31.560 --> 00:33.640
Leads elite cavalry out of the city

00:33.720 --> 00:35.720
Who knows how many will return

00:42.760 --> 00:43.680
Mount up

00:43.760 --> 00:44.880
Gag yourselves

00:46.500 --> 01:06.500
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Zhu Yuanzhi decisively abandoned the rescue of his comrades, leading the remaining cavalry in retreat.

